00:35:01.770 --> 00:35:03.750
What I like to do in
this case, where I only

00:35:03.750 --> 00:35:05.910
have kind of two
services going on,

00:35:05.910 --> 00:35:08.910
is to just look at the logs.

00:35:08.910 --> 00:35:12.060
So here on the left, I'm showing
the weather frontend logs.

00:35:12.060 --> 00:35:14.700
Here on the right, I'm showing
